  "body": "**Link to problem area**: https://spec.matrix.org/v1.2/rooms/v2/#event-format\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\nThe PDU format has the following in the example;\r\n```json5\r\n{\r\n  // ...\r\n  \"prev_events\": [\r\n    \"$af232176:example.org\",\r\n    {\r\n      \"sha256\": \"abase64encodedsha256hashshouldbe43byteslong\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  // ...\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nI believe that this sha256 hash is meant to be formatted differently than inside a separate object.",
